occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T14:14:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042019","verified_at":"2026-10-25T18:00:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1846651706694081","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.4901","summary":"TRIAD awakeningsThree new MYTHIC cards wake a fusion and a third school's card into one: GALLOWS STORM (deathmark and arc go off as one, and every mark the cut passes on rides the bolt to five more), THUNDERGLASS (stormfire and shatter go off as one, and the cinder bursts every mark round where the bolt ended) and GLACIAL STORM (brittlefire and stormrod go off as one, and its lightning hunts the frozen and freezes two more).A triad is a bonus: the wave's own card page comes right after it, so it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:37:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694081","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1846651706686093","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.4721","summary":"A fourth road: The Sulfur CalderaClearing THEME 9's warden opens the Sulfur Caldera, THEMES 10 to 13: The Tephra Town, The Obsidian Flow, The Blue-Fire Pits and The Crater Throat, each with its own floor, caves, monsters, warden and music. Its law is FUMAROLES: every 8 seconds the vents breathe steam for 2. A hiss warns first, the steam hides the monsters in it from the idle blade, and they come out scalded, walking half again as fast for 2 seconds.A new elite power, GEYSER: the Ashfall Augur ra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:06:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686093","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1846018067938566","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.4342","summary":"Nine themesThe three themes' nine places are now nine themes of their own, THEME 1 to THEME 9: Hollow Steps, Fungal Deep and Bone Reliquary are THEMES 1-3, the Gilded Waste's three places THEMES 4-6 and the Drowned Bells' THEMES 7-9. Each theme is 40 stages long: its warden waits on stage 40, and clearing it opens the next theme. On the THEMES page, pick a theme from the scene cards along the foot while its map grows from stage 1 to 40 behind it.Every run starts on its theme's stage 1. START AT ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T14:09:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938566","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1846018067935679","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.4129","summary":"ThemesThe hundred numbered tiers are gone. In their place are three themes, each with three places of its own: The Underkeep (Hollow Steps, Fungal Deep, Bone Reliquary), The Gilded Waste (The Gypsum Glare, The Cobra Wadi, The Hall of Two Truths) and The Drowned Bells (The Ebbing Shallows, The Drowned Nave, The Mother Bell). Each place is a run of 100 stages. Clearing a place's stage 100 opens the next place, and the last place's opens the next theme. Pick a place on the new THEMES tab, the first","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T08:13:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935679","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1846018067925920","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.3801","summary":"Weapon skillsEvery weapon now has three skills of its own. Z plays to the weapon's strength, X covers its weak spot, and C is its ultimate, on a long wait. Fighting with a weapon fills its mastery as your level fills, and every mastery level is a point to spend on that weapon's skills in the new WEAPONS tab of SKILLS. Z opens at mastery 1, X at 10 and C at 25, and each has an upgrade with three ranks. Mastery stays when you ascend, but it does not grow in WILD HUNT, DAILY RIFT or CASCADE.In a ru","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T12:19:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925920","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1845383656390663","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.3311","summary":"Blade formsNine new weapons to wield instead of the sword, won by clearing deeper and deeper stages. Each one cuts its own way, and each is tuned to match the sword on average. Your skills' copies of the blade take its form too.When you press RUN, you are dealt three of the forms you have won, the one you wield always among them. Take one and the run starts with it, or DEAL AGAIN once for two others. The FORMS chip opens a practice yard where you can watch any form at work first.FLAIL: a ball on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T07:11:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390663","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1845383656377312","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.2551","summary":"NewWILD HUNT: a boss rush up the tiers. It opens once you clear stage 100 on tier 3. You start with 10 random awakenings and get one more for each boss you fell. SIGNS: from level 10, hold the mouse button and draw with the blade to cast HOLD, KINDLE, BRAND, WARD or VORTEX. The signs bar rises into place with a demo that shows how to draw one. Two new skills: CROSSROADS bursts wherever your stroke crosses itself, and THREE FINGERS fans the sword into three blades.Blade skins: clear stage 100 on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T11:59:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377312","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1844751498232559","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.2247","summary":"NewDifficulty is now Tier 1–100. Each tier sets its own monster toughness, pace, crowd and pay, and higher tiers pay more shards. A new save opens Tiers 1–10. Clearing stage 100 on a tier opens ten more, and they stay open through ascension.Level Cards: you earn a pick every 10th level. Cut the pack open with your blade, choose one of three cards and drag it into your binder. It stays until you ascend. (for this, the remaining card options will be added as part of the new Ember skills in the fut","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T21:28:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232559","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5242350-1844751498226941","game_id":"steam-5242350","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes — v1.0.1933","summary":"NewRelics: embers now buy relics. 